  "title": "Vertiv and Tecogen forge global partnership to enhance cooling solutions for power-constrained data centers",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, and Tecogen Inc. (OTCQX: TGEN), a clean energy company providing ultra-efficient and clean on-site power, heating, and cooling equipment, are pleased to announce a collaboration that enables Vertiv to offer Tecogen’s advanced natural gas-powered chiller technology to data centers worldwide, addressing power constraints and facilitating the deployment of AI at scale. The Tecogen solution will expand Vertiv’s industry-leading portfolio of cooling solutions.",
